From 4e890587abebc232802eecec170b0117b28fbb20 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dcasati <dcasati@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 14:44:30 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 4/7] LinuxKPI: implement MHI host and QMI interfaces

Add an MHI host implementation (BHI/BHIe firmware download, channel and
event rings, M-state handling) and the linux/soc/qcom/qmi.h handle API
used by ath12k.  The firmware boot sequence follows OpenBSD's qwz(4).

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
